LFM2.5-VL-3B and DSpark attribution

The Hugging Face model artifacts published alongside this project are derived from Liquid AI's LFM2.5-VL-3B-DSpark checkpoint. Those model artifacts are distributed under Liquid AI's LFM Open License v1.0, not under this repository's Apache-2.0 code license. The source repository does not include model weights. Each model repository carries the upstream LFM license.

Benchmark input attribution

Downloaded COCO images are fetched from the URLs recorded in data/workload.json and are not redistributed in this repository. The benchmark also uses text from Project Gutenberg eBook 1342, Pride and Prejudice. The verbatim text and its license terms are in data/book.txt; those terms are separate from the Apache-2.0 source-code license. Source: https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1342. The chart and document-page test inputs are rendered locally; see PROVENANCE.json and data/workload.json for details.
